<PlainLayout title="Self-hosting the registry — Pilot Protocol (plain)" description="Run your own Pilot Protocol registry to use private networks, roles, OIDC/JWT identity, network policies, audit export and blueprint provisioning." canonical="https://pilotprotocol.network/plain/docs/enterprise/">

